#: {{ux|en|Several horses ran in a horse '''race''': the first one to reach the finishing post won.}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''race''' to cure cancer}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''race''' around the [[park]] was won by Johnny, who ran faster than the others.}}
#: {{ux|en|We had a '''race''' to see who could [[finish]] the book the [[quickest]].}}
