#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|first=Chad|last=Taylor|title=The Cry of the Harvest|page=115|text=Don't let fear be a factor for you as the finish line of harvest calls out to you to join the '''race''' of eternity. Clear the table of excuses and go!}}
